---
import '../styles/global.css';
import NavigationBar from '../components/NavigationBar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { Font } from 'astro:assets';
---
<style>
section {
  min-height: 100svh;
  max-width: 80vw;
  margin: 0 auto;
  font-family: var(--font-inconsolata);
}

p {
  font-weight: normal;
}

</style>

<html lang="en">
	<head>
    <Font cssVariable='--font-inconsolata' />
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/ico" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>now - developing with DominickCS_</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Find out what i'm up to right now!" />
	</head>
	<body>
    <NavigationBar />
    <main>
      <section>
        <h5>last updated 09-01-2026</h5>
        <h1>what am i doing right now?</h1>
        <div>
          <p>Man, life is getting exciting. right now my fiance and I are doing renovations on the house, only 67 more days till we get married. Studying for a change of career! God is so GOOD!</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>what am i playing?</h2>
          <p>I recently got into overwatch after not playing it for a while and I am so addicted lmao</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>what am i listening to?</h2>
          <p>call me unc but lowkey been into instrumental beats recently</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>what am i learning?</h2>
          <p>Rust, it's my goal to actually be good at a programming language lol</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>what am i building?</h2>
          <p>I am about to try and create a nice little application that synchronizes my nixos configurations to github with binary built in to my path</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
      <Footer />
	</body>
</html>
